Note, keyboard input, both as an event and as a question inside a tick.
Note, press the arrow keys to move the box and the spacebar to jump.

Open window with title Keyboard.
Add canvas board with width 400 and height 200.

Let x be 180.
Let y be 90.

When key spacebar is pressed, do the following.
Say Jump.
End when.

Every 30 milliseconds, do the following.
If key arrow left is pressed, do the following.
Subtract 4 from x.
End if.
If key arrow right is pressed, do the following.
Add 4 to x.
End if.
Clear canvas.
Draw rectangle at the value of x by the value of y with width 30 and height 30 and color pink.
End every.
